  "findings": [
    "880px reading column, mobile diagram labels and expand affordances clear; no page overflow in actual matrix.",
    "Long Java lines are intentionally locally scrollable. Screenshots show the initial horizontal position and do not prove every offscreen character; exact source sync, real clipboard comparisons and measured scrollability cover that gap.",
    "Initial shell viewport shots clipped the 409 text and parts of cards. Supplementary element captures show complete editor error, GET9000 versus PIT4500, reread closed and refreshed result cards.",
    "Stale editor404 shown above search502/503 in the initial viewport captures belongs to the separate earlier GET; supplementary editor/result captures and DOM/API checks distinguish their scopes.",
    "Overview-only images are layout/contrast checks, not pixel-by-pixel textual verification; all card fields and JSON panes were independently compared in the actual browser."
  ],
